//   producing <<n>> instead of <<n * frac_1 * frac_2>>. 0% accuracy followed.
//
// This attempt (62): force constrained-branch engagement (RenderedEndsWith) +
// fix the eager-close bug by NOT calling CloseSpanIfComplete on every step.
// Instead, use AdaptiveConstrainedStep until EOS is returned (model signals end
// of expression), THEN close the span and CONTINUE unconstrained generation
// (do not break). This allows natural multi-token expressions. The grammar
// also prevents {n} curly-brace syntax. Budget pressure uses CloseSpanWithinBudget.
