//   Constrained EOS + not IsCompletePrefix: CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition
//     guarantees the invariant. ✓
//   Constrained EOS + no remaining budget: break; invariant holds from pre-step. ✓
//   Constrained non-EOS: AdaptiveConstrainedStep hard-masks to parser-valid tokens.
//     AppendConstrainedToken extends currentConstrainedOut with that valid token,
//     preserving IsValidPrefix by the definition of valid-next extension. ✓
//
// Invariant 2 — progress:
