//     postcondition: |generatedOut| <= |generated| + closeBudget
//     = |generated| + (maxSteps - old_steps) <= |generatedPrefix| + old_steps +
//     (maxSteps - old_steps) = |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps = |generatedPrefix| + steps. ✓
//   Constrained EOS + CloseConstrainedSpan: steps += 2 total (EOS step + close step).
//     generated grows by 1 (the ">>" delimiter). Before the inner block:
