//     <= |generatedPrefix| + steps. ✓
//   Constrained EOS + CloseSpanWithinBudget: same argument as budget-pressure branch. ✓
//   Constrained non-EOS: steps += 1; AppendConstrainedToken grows generated by exactly 1. ✓
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END

